Subject: [PATCH 2/8] Port HBF-Sim HBF tier onto 91880c53 + Ramulator bridge

Ported from the validated Option B prototype (commit bb2a3324):
HBF-Sim integration-6c3cf4ff.patch applied 3-way (build-system hunks
dropped) plus the 16 hbf_* model files unchanged. Conflict fixes kept:
the L2 HBF bypass pops the queue the request came from (icnt or peer
chiplet) and checks m_L2_dram_queue->full() before pushing.
